/Assuming you have a list of numbers called ListNumbers, 
/write a MARIE program that reads and displays all the numbers from the list 
/and stops as soon as it encounters the number 5 (5 is not included).
/Ex,
/ListNumbers = {1, 44, -3, 22, 0 , 55, 5}
Load StartAddr
Store pointer

Loop,   LoadI pointer
        Jns check
        LoadI pointer
        Output
        Load pointer
        Add One
        Store pointer
        Jump Loop

check,  dec 0
        Subt Five
        Skipcond 400        /如果等于 0，就跳过下一行
        JumpI check
        Halt

StartAddr,      ADR ListNumbers
pointer,        hex 0
ListNumbers,    dec 1
                dec 44
                dec -3
                dec 22
                dec 0
                dec 55
                dec 5   / end of string
One,            dec 1
Five,           dec 5